{"hymn":"S556","parent":"E722","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"La cruz ciertamente es pesada","subtitle":"Consuelo en las pruebas—Al tener gracia para sufrir","syl":{"n1":"La","n2":"cruz","n3":["cier","i"],"n4":["ta","m"],"n5":["men","m"],"n6":["te‿es","t"],"n7":["pe","i"],"n8":["sa","m"],"n9":["da,","t"],"n11":"Mas","n12":"Su","n13":["gra","i"],"n14":["cia","t"],"n15":"es","n16":["ma","i"],"n17":["yor;","t"],"n19":"Y","n20":["aun","i"],"n21":["que","t"],"n22":["vi","i"],"n23":["nie","m"],"n24":["ran","t"],"n25":["tor","i"],"n26":["men","m"],"n27":["tas,","t"],"n29":"Yo","n30":["ve","i"],"n31":["ré","t"],"n32":"la","n33":"faz","n34":"de","n35":"Dios.","n37":"La","n38":["gra","i"],"n39":["cia","t"],"n40":"de","n41":"Dios","n42":"me","n43":["bas","i"],"n44":["ta","m"],"n45":["rá,","t"],"n47":["Tor","i"],"n48":["men","m"],"n49":["tas,","t"],"n50":"Su","n51":"faz","n52":["no‿o","i"],"n53":["cul","m"],"n54":["ta","m"],"n55":["rán;","t"],"n56":["Sa","i"],"n57":["tis","m"],"n58":["fa","m"],"n59":["ce","t"],"n60":"el","n61":["sa","i"],"n62":["ber","t"],"n63":"Que","n64":["Je","i"],"n65":["sús","t"],"n66":["con","i"],"n67":["mi","m"],"n68":["go‿es","m"],"n69":["tá,","t"],"n70":"Que","n71":["pue","i"],"n72":["do‿a","t"],"n73":["Sa","i"],"n74":["tán","t"],"n75":["ven","i"],"n76":["cer.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["No son más agudos mis cardos","Que los que Él llevó por mí;","Ni mi cáliz es tan amargo","Como el de Getsemaní."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["La luz de Su amor va en aumento","Cuando brilla en mi penar;","Mi carga más leve se hace","Si al débil puedo alzar."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Cumplir Su designio me alegra","Al andar frente a Su faz;","Las pruebas me traen más gracia;","Cristo en ellas es mi paz."]}]}